MANAGEDSETTINGSAGENT(8)     System Manager's Manual    MANAGEDSETTINGSAGENT(8)

NAME
     ManagedSettingsAgent – Managed Settings Agent

DESCRIPTION
     ManagedSettingsAgent persists the effective value of managed settings and
     notifies interested parties about changes in those settings.

